WEBVTT

00:00:01.219 --> 00:00:06.089
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:07.129 --> 00:00:12.459
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:24.109 --> 00:00:29.379
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:30.119 --> 00:00:34.749
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:35.989 --> 00:00:41.259
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.799 --> 00:00:46.999
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:47.399 --> 00:00:50.929
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:56.099
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.739 --> 00:01:01.239
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.819 --> 00:01:08.779
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.859 --> 00:01:14.759
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tsuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.829 --> 00:01:21.389
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.669 --> 00:01:27.539
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:02:17.759 --> 00:02:19.889
Have we met before?

00:02:20.899 --> 00:02:21.859
No.

00:02:22.329 --> 00:02:23.349
However...

00:02:23.429 --> 00:02:26.489
...there isn't anyone who doesn't
know of Taihaku from Icolo.

00:03:06.309 --> 00:03:07.269
Haseo.

00:03:13.609 --> 00:03:14.409
Shino!

00:03:14.979 --> 00:03:15.949
Shino!

00:03:16.119 --> 00:03:18.419
Come on! Hang in there!

00:03:19.949 --> 00:03:20.849
Repth.

00:03:21.589 --> 00:03:22.559
Repth.

00:03:30.559 --> 00:03:31.999
What is this?

00:03:32.369 --> 00:03:33.329
Damn it!

00:03:42.839 --> 00:03:45.039
Come on! Answer your phone!

00:03:47.079 --> 00:03:47.739
Come on!

00:03:49.319 --> 00:03:50.309
Please!

00:03:50.719 --> 00:03:51.339
Hurry!

00:03:55.989 --> 00:03:56.789
Shino!

00:04:02.329 --> 00:04:05.059
Sh-Shino...

00:04:38.029 --> 00:04:39.469
What is this?

00:04:41.639 --> 00:04:43.359
What the hell is this?!

00:04:45.209 --> 00:04:46.169
Damn it!

00:04:46.339 --> 00:04:49.099
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

00:04:55.479 --> 00:04:57.109
Damn it...

00:05:01.089 --> 00:05:02.749
Hey, are you going?

00:05:03.059 --> 00:05:06.889
I told you I'm not interested in
going to a pointless official event.

00:05:07.899 --> 00:05:10.389
An official event?

00:05:10.929 --> 00:05:14.129
But what do they mean you
can't get back in if you come out once?

00:05:14.339 --> 00:05:16.329
That's not an event.

00:05:24.909 --> 00:05:27.209
Uh, you're that...

00:05:27.279 --> 00:05:29.079
What's this official event about?

00:05:29.149 --> 00:05:30.979
You mean the "Forest of Pain"?

00:05:32.349 --> 00:05:33.719
Forest of Pain?

00:05:34.049 --> 00:05:36.649
Haven't you seen the email about it?

00:05:37.059 --> 00:05:39.179
If you want to know more...

00:05:39.259 --> 00:05:42.389
...players who've challenged it
are talking about it on the forum.

00:05:44.699 --> 00:05:47.929
I haven't had time to look at it yet.

00:05:54.239 --> 00:05:55.539
It's a week long.

00:05:55.809 --> 00:05:56.739
During that time...

00:05:56.809 --> 00:05:59.139
...you have to do something
at the deepest point of the field.

00:05:59.209 --> 00:06:00.269
Do what?

00:06:00.349 --> 00:06:03.679
Beats me. Only those who reach
that point can find out.

00:06:03.749 --> 00:06:06.019
So no one knows?

00:06:06.249 --> 00:06:10.019
The enemies are unusually strong.
So far no one has cleared it yet.

00:06:10.289 --> 00:06:13.419
In the forum, some are saying
it's impossible to clear.

00:06:15.629 --> 00:06:18.329
Why don't you find information
on your own for once?

00:06:19.529 --> 00:06:20.799
I have to go.

00:06:21.039 --> 00:06:23.439
I'm busy setting up a new guild.

00:06:23.769 --> 00:06:25.029
Oh! I'm sorry.

00:06:28.609 --> 00:06:29.699
I see...

00:06:30.639 --> 00:06:35.739
So Kuhn's setting up a new guild.

00:06:52.199 --> 00:06:53.499
So you came.

00:06:53.599 --> 00:06:55.429
I want to ask you something.

00:06:58.739 --> 00:07:01.439
About Shino and the guy?

00:07:03.409 --> 00:07:05.779
I want to ask you about Tri-Edge.

00:07:06.849 --> 00:07:08.309
What about him?

00:07:08.419 --> 00:07:09.609
I want to meet him.

00:07:10.219 --> 00:07:14.309
You know you can't just meet
him because you want to.

00:07:15.059 --> 00:07:17.649
Tell me about the time you met him.

00:07:18.259 --> 00:07:21.959
He appeared in a place other than
a Lost Ground that has Signs.

00:07:22.029 --> 00:07:23.329
Something must be up.

00:07:23.629 --> 00:07:25.719
That doesn't change anything.

00:07:26.369 --> 00:07:27.329
Please!

00:07:28.839 --> 00:07:33.799
Haseo, you need to forget
about Tri-Edge.

00:07:34.909 --> 00:07:36.809
I can't do that!

00:07:38.609 --> 00:07:41.779
Shino still lies unconscious
in the real world.

00:07:41.849 --> 00:07:43.109
I know that.

00:07:43.379 --> 00:07:46.319
The doctors have no idea
what's caused her condition.

00:07:46.389 --> 00:07:47.449
You went there?

00:07:48.459 --> 00:07:50.579
Because they don't know
the cause...

00:07:50.659 --> 00:07:52.959
...they don't know how to treat her.

00:07:53.689 --> 00:07:56.989
That's why I have to meet Tri-Edge.

00:07:58.099 --> 00:08:00.069
Even so...

00:08:00.529 --> 00:08:02.129
...you have to give it up.

00:08:34.099 --> 00:08:36.469
Which one should I assign Saburou to?

00:08:37.369 --> 00:08:39.399
Which is the real one?

00:08:39.569 --> 00:08:42.169
They both joined at the same time.

00:08:42.379 --> 00:08:43.339
Haseo.

00:08:43.409 --> 00:08:45.109
Tabby.

00:08:45.349 --> 00:08:48.579
Neither of them have
large amounts of data like Ovan.

00:08:48.779 --> 00:08:52.979
Did you notice anything
when you were in TaN?

00:08:53.189 --> 00:08:55.019
If I did, I would've told you then.

00:08:55.389 --> 00:08:58.589
I know you reported everything.

00:08:59.229 --> 00:09:02.859
Even then you never failed to catch
the small details.

00:09:03.399 --> 00:09:04.259
But...

00:09:04.329 --> 00:09:05.529
Nevertheless...

00:09:06.699 --> 00:09:09.599
Tabby has had contact
with the unknown.

00:09:10.869 --> 00:09:13.399
Although Haseo was there, too.

00:09:15.009 --> 00:09:18.709
Well, we'll leave Haseo alone
for a little while longer.

00:09:19.679 --> 00:09:22.769
If he contacts Tri-Edge on his own...

00:09:22.849 --> 00:09:24.879
...it will be very interesting.

00:09:26.049 --> 00:09:29.249
I'll leave it to you to decide
how to move the pieces.

00:09:29.319 --> 00:09:30.719
You can count on me.

00:09:56.379 --> 00:09:58.849
What are you doing?

00:10:02.619 --> 00:10:03.589
Hello?!

00:10:04.829 --> 00:10:05.949
