00:10:06.229 --> 00:10:08.589
I came exactly when I said I would.

00:10:09.829 --> 00:10:11.959
This is a really nice place, isn't it?

00:10:12.369 --> 00:10:15.199
You'd feel good if you slept
in a place like this.

00:10:15.869 --> 00:10:17.429
A nice place, huh?

00:10:18.139 --> 00:10:20.969
Hey, is it really necessary
to meet here?

00:10:21.239 --> 00:10:23.609
I just don't want to meet in town.

00:10:24.409 --> 00:10:27.309
Even though TaN
isn't around anymore?

00:10:29.079 --> 00:10:31.279
Hey, did you read my email?

00:10:31.489 --> 00:10:32.449
I did.

00:10:32.749 --> 00:10:34.279
The beast girl.

00:10:34.519 --> 00:10:35.819
But it's strange.

00:10:35.959 --> 00:10:37.049
