00:10:46.969 --> 00:10:49.869
But the other kid seems
so much more interesting.

00:10:50.399 --> 00:10:54.469
It's like when my brother grabs my snack
that I was saving to enjoy last.

00:10:54.909 --> 00:10:56.379
I don't get it...

00:10:56.439 --> 00:10:57.999
But be sure to make contact.

00:10:58.079 --> 00:10:59.099
Just contact?

00:10:59.179 --> 00:11:00.149
Right.

00:11:00.279 --> 00:11:02.869
If you can do that properly,
I'll tell you what to do next.

00:11:03.049 --> 00:11:04.039
