it won't do any good to meet Tri-Edge.

00:13:59.659 --> 00:14:03.459
He's not the kind of PC who will
just listen to you.

00:14:03.529 --> 00:14:04.899
What do you mean?

00:14:05.129 --> 00:14:07.029
He doesn't seem that way.

00:14:07.099 --> 00:14:10.189
He'll attack without saying a word.

00:14:10.269 --> 00:14:13.069
You ran away from him, didn't you?

00:14:13.539 --> 00:14:17.239
I don't know any players
who can beat that PC.

00:14:17.509 --> 00:14:19.449
I won't know until I try.

00:14:19.509 --> 00:14:20.499
Are you an idiot?!

00:14:20.979 --> 00:14:22.349
I have to try.

00:14:22.419 --> 00:14:25.509
If you try and fail,
you'll become a Lost One.

00:14:25.589 --> 00:14:27.179
The risk is too high.

00:14:27.349 --> 00:14:29.479
But he spared you!

00:14:29.759 --> 00:14:32.589
But he might not spare you.

00:14:38.999 --> 00:14:40.929
Please, don't fight.

00:14:49.009 --> 00:14:51.339
Just get on with it already.

00:14:58.589 --> 00:14:59.549
Haseo!

00:15:01.689 --> 00:15:04.849
How can you possibly
match Tri-Edge...

00:15:04.929 --> 00:15:07.759
...if you can't even fend off
a Harvest's attack?

00:15:08.599 --> 00:15:10.259
Don't you see now?

00:15:10.329 --> 00:15:11.389
You...!

00:15:15.539 --> 00:15:16.499
Hey!

00:15:16.739 --> 00:15:20.699
At present, I'm probably the only survivor.

00:15:21.169 --> 00:15:23.139
I know his strength.

00:15:23.209 --> 00:15:24.509
So what?

00:15:24.739 --> 00:15:27.039
Don't you want to help Shino?

00:15:28.449 --> 00:15:30.279
You're gonna regret this.

00:15:30.519 --> 00:15:33.779
Watch your mouth, young one.

00:15:40.189 --> 00:15:41.519
Is that all?

00:15:41.599 --> 00:15:42.579
Shut up!

00:15:48.399 --> 00:15:51.129
It's not like I don't understand
how you feel.

00:15:51.199 --> 00:15:54.439
But what happened to Shino
is not your fault.

00:15:54.509 --> 00:15:55.629
It is my fault.

00:15:55.709 --> 00:15:57.399
Don't make me repeat myself.

00:15:58.009 --> 00:15:59.709
You're a child that won't listen.

00:15:59.779 --> 00:16:01.939
You can't see anything
around you.

00:16:06.249 --> 00:16:08.379
Both of you, stop it...

00:16:09.919 --> 00:16:12.049
So there is a survivor.

00:16:14.629 --> 00:16:18.089
Phyllo, what are you to Ovan?

00:16:33.609 --> 00:16:35.479
Do you get it now?

00:16:35.549 --> 00:16:38.809
If you meet him you'll end up
the same as everyone else.

00:16:38.949 --> 00:16:40.579
I won't lose.

00:16:41.449 --> 00:16:43.889
Even if I die,
I have to see Tri-Edge...

00:16:46.689 --> 00:16:50.459
Even if you die?!
Don't use those words so lightly!

00:16:51.459 --> 00:16:52.559
I...

00:16:53.399 --> 00:16:55.369
I'll take care of things.

00:16:56.199 --> 00:16:57.399
Thank you...

00:16:58.839 --> 00:16:59.829
...Haseo.

00:17:01.939 --> 00:17:03.569
I have to do something.

00:17:03.879 --> 00:17:05.399
Do something?

00:17:05.809 --> 00:17:08.439
You can't do anything
the way you are now.

00:17:14.919 --> 00:17:16.679
Go cool your head.

00:17:17.659 --> 00:17:18.679
Haseo!

00:17:18.789 --> 00:17:20.189
Why are you...?

00:17:20.729 --> 00:17:22.749
Phyllo, isn't that enough?

00:17:22.829 --> 00:17:24.849
Let Haseo do what he wants!

00:17:24.929 --> 00:17:26.629
You don't need to defend me!

00:17:28.029 --> 00:17:29.019
Tabby.

00:17:30.599 --> 00:17:32.939
I'm sure Haseo can do it.

00:17:33.209 --> 00:17:36.399
If he can't even beat me,
how can he possibly...?

00:17:36.479 --> 00:17:39.569
Violence can't be
a solution to everything.

00:17:40.549 --> 00:17:42.709
But there are opponents like that.

00:17:43.779 --> 00:17:44.839
That's enough.

00:17:47.419 --> 00:17:49.819
I understand the way you feel.

00:17:52.589 --> 00:17:54.719
So I just have to get stronger, right?

00:17:56.699 --> 00:17:59.059
I can't tell if they get along or not.

00:18:06.469 --> 00:18:08.269
I'm sorry about before.

00:18:08.339 --> 00:18:09.499
About what?

00:18:09.609 --> 00:18:11.439
I think I got in the way.

00:18:11.509 --> 00:18:14.239
You thought it was
the right thing to do, right?

00:18:16.379 --> 00:18:18.109
I just couldn't watch.

00:18:18.749 --> 00:18:25.019
If only Haseo would stop thinking
he can do everything by himself.

00:18:27.389 --> 00:18:28.219
Huh?

00:18:28.289 --> 00:18:31.889
What did you say?
Sorry, my system just lagged.

00:18:31.969 --> 00:18:33.299
That's all right.

00:18:45.649 --> 00:18:47.339
This is nothing.

00:18:48.079 --> 00:18:49.669
Let's go back.

00:18:49.749 --> 00:18:51.479
They're too strong here.

00:18:51.689 --> 00:18:54.309
It's nothing compared
to the Forest of Pain.

00:18:54.749 --> 00:18:57.379
The rumors say that
ridiculously strong monsters...

00:18:57.459 --> 00:19:00.049
...keep coming at you
without a break.

00:19:00.229 --> 00:19:01.779
Sounds terrible.

00:19:01.859 --> 00:19:02.889
Not really.

00:19:03.029 --> 00:19:05.549
If you clear it you'll become
exceptionally strong.

00:19:05.629 --> 00:19:07.499
But that's a rumor, too.

00:19:08.769 --> 00:19:11.399
Where do you get that
kind of information?

00:19:12.709 --> 00:19:13.759
Is that right?!

00:19:26.189 --> 00:19:27.409
Can I sit beside you?

00:19:30.589 --> 00:19:31.749
Who are you?

00:19:32.089 --> 00:19:35.149
My PC data is public.

00:19:37.859 --> 00:19:39.629
This place is nice.

00:19:39.699 --> 00:19:41.559
A good place for people watching.

00:19:41.799 --> 00:19:42.729
Um...

00:19:42.799 --> 00:19:46.029
You're a girl, right?
Saburou?

00:19:46.109 --> 00:19:46.799
Yeah.

00:19:46.869 --> 00:19:47.839
Why?

00:19:48.109 --> 00:19:50.799
Saburou's a weird name for a girl.

00:19:50.879 --> 00:19:53.739
That's such a stereotype.

00:19:54.279 --> 00:19:55.939
Stereotype?

00:19:58.079 --> 00:20:01.609
There are boys with names
like "Kaoru" or "Hiromi".

00:20:01.689 --> 00:20:03.879
Are there any boys
called "Hanako"?

00:20:03.959 --> 00:20:06.079
Hanako's my great grandfather's name.

00:20:06.159 --> 00:20:07.319
What?!

00:20:09.959 --> 00:20:11.119
Just kidding.

00:20:16.339 --> 00:20:20.969
I'm waiting here for
my friend Haseo to pass by.

00:20:24.079 --> 00:20:25.369
He's amazing.

00:20:25.449 --> 00:20:28.009
He lives up to our expectations.

00:20:28.309 --> 00:20:29.209
What about you?

00:20:29.279 --> 00:20:30.539
Me?

00:20:35.559 --> 00:20:37.109
I'm useless.

00:20:37.389 --> 00:20:40.789
If you say that you won't be
able to do anything, you really won't.

00:20:40.859 --> 00:20:43.889
If you think everything will be okay,
everything will be fine.

00:20:43.959 --> 00:20:47.589
It's like a curry that will last for days
if it's kept simmering.

00:20:50.099 --> 00:20:51.329
What does that mean?

00:20:55.879 --> 00:21:14.559
I'd rather dig deep into the earth

00:21:14.589 --> 00:21:19.759
And bury this small newly born light

00:21:20.429 --> 00:21:22.139
Than my despair

00:21:22.139 --> 00:21:24.639
Than my despair
There are no people.

00:21:24.639 --> 00:21:29.979
Than my despair

00:21:29.979 --> 00:21:31.239
Than my despair
Excuse me?

00:21:31.239 --> 00:21:31.809
Than my despair

00:21:31.809 --> 00:21:32.709
Than my despair
Who are you?

00:21:32.709 --> 00:21:33.039
Who are you?

00:21:33.279 --> 00:21:35.319
I'm happy I know no song

00:21:35.319 --> 00:21:37.079
I'm happy I know no song
Do you have a moment?

00:21:37.079 --> 00:21:39.479
I'm happy I know no song

00:21:39.549 --> 00:21:45.719
That will wake you from your sleep

00:21:45.789 --> 00:21:52.319
It's better that people forget

00:21:52.399 --> 00:22:00.699
They live with death

00:22:02.879 --> 00:22:06.329
All I have to do
is get stronger! Stronger!

00:22:30.169 --> 00:22:33.759
Ikiru wa dokuhai kiyu no kurushimi wo
Life is a poisoned cup of needless suffering

00:22:33.839 --> 00:22:37.279
Nomihosu sube wo dare ga sazukeyo
That no one can show me how to drain

00:22:37.539 --> 00:22:40.939
Taiyo ni sumu toiu kenja no washi
A wise eagle is said to live in the sun

00:22:41.009 --> 00:22:45.379
Habataki dake ga kodama suru
The flapping of its wings
is all that echoes

00:22:48.859 --> 00:22:52.419
Kono futatsu no me ni yadotta
In each of these eyes

00:22:52.489 --> 00:22:56.189
Yami to Hikari sono docchi de
Dwell darkness and light

00:22:56.259 --> 00:23:03.529
Boku wa ashita wo mitsumeru
beki nano darou
Through which shall I look to tomorrow?

00:23:03.599 --> 00:23:07.229
Kawaki kitta gareki no machi
A dried out and ruined city

00:23:07.309 --> 00:23:10.999
Ten to sen wo tsunagi awase
Draws the lines between the dots

00:23:11.079 --> 00:23:18.009
Imi nado nai koto bakari afurete iku
Causing meaningless events to overflow

00:23:18.179 --> 00:23:21.849
Honou no gotoki kodoku
Soothing the loneliness

00:23:21.919 --> 00:23:24.949
Idaku karada shizumete wa
That flames up within the body

00:23:25.019 --> 00:23:32.559
Ankyo eto shitatatte iku shizuku
Droplets of water fall towards the culvert

00:23:32.799 --> 00:23:36.289
Kakageru dokuhai kono sei wa michitemo
Even if the poisoned cup is upheld
and filled with this life

00:23:36.399 --> 00:23:40.099
Kogareru shino yume wa nagare tsuku
My dream that yearns for death
drifts into it

00:23:40.309 --> 00:23:43.739
Toride ni kuikomu tsume kokou no washi
The eagle remains aloof;
its talons dig into the fort

00:23:43.809 --> 00:23:47.439
Habataki dake ga maiagaru
Only the flapping of its wings resounds

00:23:47.509 --> 00:23:51.239
Ano soukyu ni takkei ni shite kure tamae
Let me be crucified in the blue sky

00:23:51.319 --> 00:23:54.679
Ten to chi ga musubu basho ni
bokuwa tatsu
I'll stand where heaven and earth meet

00:23:56.119 --> 00:23:57.589
Next Episode
